{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rune it Out is a multiplayer PVP game but you can also play with AI.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you combine different runes to cast spells that will change the map and turn your friends to dust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great dwarven Smith was born in a magical world. He was so skilled in smithing that he felt limited by physical means alone. To surpass these limitations, he incorporated magic into his craft and invented a new object called a rune. By combining runes, he developed a new method of casting magic, which he called &quot;Rune Casting.&quot; Soon after, an arena was built where the most skilled &quot;Rune mages&quot; competed for fame and mana. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/extras/8ff35e93fd30ef93c378b58e155fe39a.avif?t=1728827922\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/extras_big/8ff35e93fd30ef93c378b58e155fe39a.avif?t=1728827922 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer and Singleplayer(AI)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple character choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine Different runes to create amazing spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully Interactive map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Progressing Grimoire (Spell Book)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill other &quot;Rune Mages&quot; to gain their &quot;rune mana&quot; and use it to unlock new spells in a grimoire</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/extras/eadae92ab1295102b31b25d408a96d76.avif?t=1728827922\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/extras_big/eadae92ab1295102b31b25d408a96d76.avif?t=1728827922 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Chanting </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type your spells as fast as you can. Otherwise, your RuneMage also won't chant them fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/extras/2c59e7c79330bb5497b60ae8c99b4e2d.avif?t=1728827922\" width=700 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Miscasting :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Concentrate on casting your spells. If you don't, you will miscast them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Artefact Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not long after, a new competition the &quot;Artefact Battle&quot; was invented, one in which multiple &quot;Rune Mages&quot; clashed their spells against each other to attain an Artefact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/extras/da650fa0e85f3eaab4324b4a9f40b990.avif?t=1728827922\" width=500 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Clashing spells: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to counter the enemy spells as fast as possible</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiplayer PvP </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mana:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Counter, the spells of your enemies or hit them with your own to acquire mana and Achieve Victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2213910?t=1728827922","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1728827922","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1728827922","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1728827922","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Check out My NEWEST Game!</h1><p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/extras/b6c2f94e1570f73cae4abcd112836d74.avif?t=1728827922\" width=600 height=326 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rune it Out is a multiplayer PVP game but you can also play with AI.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you combine different runes to cast spells that will change the map and turn your friends to dust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great dwarven Smith was born in a magical world. He was so skilled in smithing that he felt limited by physical means alone. To surpass these limitations, he incorporated magic into his craft and invented a new object called a rune. By combining runes, he developed a new method of casting magic, which he called &quot;Rune Casting.&quot; Soon after, an arena was built where the most skilled &quot;Rune mages&quot; competed for fame and mana. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/extras/8ff35e93fd30ef93c378b58e155fe39a.avif?t=1728827922\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/extras_big/8ff35e93fd30ef93c378b58e155fe39a.avif?t=1728827922 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer and Singleplayer(AI)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple character choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine Different runes to create amazing spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully Interactive map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Progressing Grimoire (Spell Book)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill other &quot;Rune Mages&quot; to gain their &quot;rune mana&quot; and use it to unlock new spells in a grimoire</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/extras/eadae92ab1295102b31b25d408a96d76.avif?t=1728827922\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/extras_big/eadae92ab1295102b31b25d408a96d76.avif?t=1728827922 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Chanting </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type your spells as fast as you can. Otherwise, your RuneMage also won't chant them fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/extras/2c59e7c79330bb5497b60ae8c99b4e2d.avif?t=1728827922\" width=700 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Miscasting :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Concentrate on casting your spells. If you don't, you will miscast them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Artefact Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not long after, a new competition the &quot;Artefact Battle&quot; was invented, one in which multiple &quot;Rune Mages&quot; clashed their spells against each other to attain an Artefact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/extras/da650fa0e85f3eaab4324b4a9f40b990.avif?t=1728827922\" width=500 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Clashing spells: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to counter the enemy spells as fast as possible</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiplayer PvP </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mana:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Counter, the spells of your enemies or hit them with your own to acquire mana and Achieve Victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Ill-Fated Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/header.jpg?t=1728827922","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2213910/603942/c92fa747939510224993023cb1a1007725589751/1751090915/dash_av1.mpd?t=1697998033","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2213910/603942/c92fa747939510224993023cb1a1007725589751/1751090915/dash_h264.mpd?t=1697998033","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2213910/603942/c92fa747939510224993023cb1a1007725589751/1751090915/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1697998033","id":256967565,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256967565/movie480.mp4?t=1697998033","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256967565/movie_max.mp4?t=1697998033"},"name":"Arena Mode Trailer","thu